      "content": "In mandarin. Cause the English is too long and can’t see.\n\nDevour extra maxed advancement SR SSR UR FULL PETS -> level 160 \n\nReconstruct for Stigmata extra fragments -> level 150 and server day 78\n\nFire bird for extra wings fragment -> lvl 162 and server day 71\n\nDevour for orbs -> lvl 172 and 99th day",
