      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Devour opens when you’re at level 160\n\nHow does Devour or creature work? \n\nOnly pets that reached +13, their dupes can be devoured. (Which means any extra copies of that +13 SSR SR UR can be devoured) \n\nAfter maxing the advancement of all your pets, you find out that hey I have spare SSR SR UR lying around, what can I do? Since my pets are all +13? \n\nThe function of devour is to devour the extra pets you have in your bag to gain stats",
      "author": {
