      "content": "The creature has 2 different devour. \n\n1 for SSR / SR\nSSR : 50 EXP\nSR : 10 EXP\n\nThe other for UR\nMainly focusing on skill bonus such as shield, stuns, atk and def bonuses at later part \n\nBoth with different effects and attribute bonuses",
